<rms:rms_experience_0_company>NeoKids Pro</rms:rms_experience_0_company>
<rms:rms_experience_0_dateBegin>January 2026</rms:rms_experience_0_dateBegin>
<rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginFormat>
<rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginTS>1767225600</rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginTS>
<rms:rms_experience_0_dateEnd>Present</rms:rms_experience_0_dateEnd>
<rms:rms_experience_0_description>Deployed NeoKidsPro.in, a responsive pediatric clinic website using WordPress, Elementor Pro, and ACF, featuring  10+ custom pages, widgets, and CMS-driven components for booking and content management, reducing manual appointment handling by 40%.&#xA;Architected Neo Kids EMR using Next.js, Node.js, Express.js, MySQL, and Prisma, consolidating patient records, prescriptions, appointments, and invoicing across 2 portals, cutting administrative workload by 50%.&#xA;Enforced JWT authentication and RBAC across 2 user roles, integrating 3 third-party APIs (Cashfree, Meta WhatsApp Cloud API, Google Calendar) to fully automate payments, scheduling, and patient communication.</rms:rms_experience_0_description>
<rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>true</rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>
<rms:rms_experience_0_location>Remote / Freelance</rms:rms_experience_0_location>
<rms:rms_experience_0_role>Full-Stack Developer</rms:rms_experience_0_role>
<rms:rms_experience_1_company>Pediatrician Instagram</rms:rms_experience_1_company>
<rms:rms_experience_1_dateBegin>February 2025</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBegin>
<rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginFormat>
<rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>1738368000</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>
<rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>March 2026</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>
<rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>
<rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>1772323200</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>
<rms:rms_experience_1_description>Designed 30+ monthly content assets including reels, carousels, and educational graphics, maintaining 100% on-schedule delivery.&#xA;Scheduled and managed a 12-month content calendar, ensuring consistent weekly publishing across all formats.&#xA;Partnered with 3+ pediatric experts to co-develop educational campaigns, broadening community reach and establishing credibility among 1,000+ parents.</rms:rms_experience_1_description>
<rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>
<rms:rms_experience_1_location>Remote / Part-Time</rms:rms_experience_1_location>
<rms:rms_experience_1_role>Social Media &amp; Content Designer</rms:rms_experience_1_role>
<rms:rms_experience_count>2</rms:rms_experience_count>
<rms:rms_involvement_count>0</rms:rms_involvement_count>
<rms:rms_project_0_description>Engineered a full-stack LMS featuring 2 dedicated dashboards, supporting end-to-end course creation, enrollment, and progress tracking for 5+ platform features.&#xA;Delivered 5+ platform features including authentication, course administration, and reporting, supporting full learner lifecycle management.&#xA;Delivered responsive React and Next.js interfaces with RBAC, protected routes, and secure access control across 2 user roles.</rms:rms_project_0_description>
<rms:rms_project_0_title>Nexus - Learning Management System                                                                                                              GitHub Repository</rms:rms_project_0_title>
<rms:rms_project_1_description>Designed a Notion-inspired productivity platform with 5+ workspace modules covering document creation, nested hierarchies, authentication, content management, and real-time sync.&#xA;Integrated Clerk authentication and Convex backend for secure access control, real-time database operations, and scalable full-stack architecture.&#xA;Streamlined 5+ document workflows â€” creation, editing, and retrieval â€” reducing navigation time by 30%.&#xA;Built responsive React and Next.js interfaces with dynamic state management and low-latency updates.</rms:rms_project_1_description>
<rms:rms_project_1_title>Notion-Inspired Productivity Platform                                                                                                              GitHub Repository</rms:rms_project_1_title>
<rms:rms_project_count>2</rms:rms_project_count>
<rms:rms_publication_count>0</rms:rms_publication_count>
<rms:rms_reference_count>0</rms:rms_reference_count>
<rms:rms_schema_details>https://github.com/rezi-io/resume-standard</rms:rms_schema_details>
<rms:rms_skill_0_category>Design</rms:rms_skill_0_category>
<rms:rms_skill_0_keywords>Figma, Wireframing, Prototyping, User Flows, Visual Design, Responsive Design&#xA;Frontend: React, Next.js, TypeScript, JavaScript, Tailwind CSS&#xA;Backend: Node.js, Express.js, Prisma ORM, MySQL, REST APIs, JWT Authentication&#xA;Tools: WordPress, Elementor Pro, Git, GitHub, SEO</rms:rms_skill_0_keywords>
<rms:rms_skill_count>1</rms:rms_skill_count>
<rms:rms_summary>Results-driven IT professional with expertise in full-stack web development and UX/UI design. Proven track record of designing user-centric interfaces in Figma and building scalable web applications using React, Next.js, and Node.js. Adept at integrating third-party APIs and implementing secure authentication systems to enhance platform functionality.</rms:rms_summary>
